\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Breakdown points $\kappa ^*$: the smallest assumed spill-over fraction at which a finding stops holding, per section, on the grid $\kappa \in \{0, 0.05, 0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.4\}$ with three seeds each. $>$0.4: the finding holds at every grid point. Bold: a break. LR: ligand--receptor. $^{a}$The interval of the seed mean contains $0$; $^{b}$a seed has the opposite sign. n/a: no tumour cells on the TMA sections. The serial section is read through the core's fits. \leavevmode {\color  {violet}\textbf  {?}}: \leavevmode {\color  {violet}\textbf  {[PENDING RUNS: breakdown gaps, landing tonight; findings per section become 7/7/7/6/6]}}. Trajectories and diagnostics: Supplement\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {app:sweep}.\relax }}{7}{table.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:kappa-star}{{3}{7}{Breakdown points $\kappa ^*$: the smallest assumed spill-over fraction at which a finding stops holding, per section, on the grid $\kappa \in \{0, 0.05, 0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.4\}$ with three seeds each. $>$0.4: the finding holds at every grid point. Bold: a break. LR: ligand--receptor. $^{a}$The interval of the seed mean contains $0$; $^{b}$a seed has the opposite sign. n/a: no tumour cells on the TMA sections. The serial section is read through the core's fits. \textcolor {violet}{\textbf {?}}: \pending {breakdown gaps, landing tonight; findings per section become 7/7/7/6/6}. Trajectories and diagnostics: \suppref {app:sweep}.\relax }{table.caption.12}{}}
\newlabel{tab:kappa-star@cref}{{[table][3][]3}{[1][7][]7}}
